  "content": "Context: 9. Restrictions regarding marriage\n\n5. A divorcee need not seek permission to contract a second marriage with a divorcee or a person having no spouse living.\n6. When a Government servant marries or is married to a foreign national, the fact should be intimated to the Government.GIDs (1) and (2), Rule 21.",
